ory\">مَآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نتَ</span> مُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نذِ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ‌ۖ وَ</span>لِكُلِّ قَوْمٍ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">هَا</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دٍ</span>","ٱللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ مَا تَحْمِلُ كُلُّ أُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نثَ</span>ىٰ وَمَا تَغِيضُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْحَامُ وَمَا تَزْدَادُ‌ۖ وَكُلُّ شَىْءٍ عِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ندَ</span>هُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> بِمِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">قْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">دَا</span>رٍ","<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">عَٰ</span>لِمُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْغَيْبِ وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هَٰ</span>دَةِ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكَبِيرُ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْمُتَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissible\">عَا</span>لِ","سَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">وَآ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">ءٌ مِّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">نكُ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_shafawi\">م مَّ</span>نْ أَسَرَّ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَوْلَ وَمَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">ن جَ</span>هَرَ بِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">هِۦ</span> وَمَنْ هُوَ مُسْتَخْ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">فِۭ بِ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّيْلِ وَسَارِ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-iqlab\">بُۢ بِ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">نَّ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_permissibl